- op: discuss  # 25ab
  at: '2026-07-03T17:34:10Z'  # 25ab
  by: agent  # 25ab
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 25ab
  clock: 3  # 25ab
  nonce: 25ab  # 25ab
  message: "Landed in PR #407 (dev 3e11c3ca17). D2: process_code_block emits an unresolved calls edge + receiver_type_hint for a @property read on a var_types-typed instance (function/method scope); the inherited_calls linker mints the resolved calls->getter edge via strict Site-2 Step-1 (getter is kind='method' with a Class.attr name, so build_method_index finds it — no linker change). Gated by _resolve_property_getter (kind method + a decorator named exactly 'property'); plain field/non-property method/untyped receiver/Store-write/bare-CLASS receiver all emit nothing. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (item's own flagship repro, real hypergumbo-tracker package via run_behavior_map): ValidationResult.ok — previously 0 incoming calls (dead: property reads emit no edge) — now has 1 incoming RESOLVED calls edge from _cmd_validate (is_resolved=True, origin=inherited-calls); getter reachable, FP cleared. Adversarial review (wf_b1e410fd-9d9) caught a coverage-hidden MODULE-scope ratchet regression (file-kind src -> new runtime_coherence offender in the (file,python,external_symbol,python) partition), fixed by gating to function/method callers; verified vs test_substrate_within_ratchet_baseline. Both packages 100% coverage. Deferred: inherited @property (WI-hiziz/D1), read-write getter+setter (WI-sizut). Filed shared pre-existing gaps: INV-finoh (taint sanitizer gate), INV-ruluv (sub-scope var_types leak)."  # 25ab
